    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33875" root="فسق" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْسَقُ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> or <i>most, characterized by</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِسْق</span>].
The Arabs say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَعَنَ ٱللّٰهُ أَفْسَقِى وأَفْسَقَكَ</span>, meaning,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَفْسَقَ مِنَّا</span> [i. e. <i>May God curse the more characterized by</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِسْق</span>, <i>of us,</i> or <i>of me and thee</i>]. (Fr, O.)

